swimlane-beta LR
  accTitle: Support escalation
  accDescr: A request starts with the customer, is triaged by support, and may be escalated to engineering.

  subgraph Customer
    request[Open request]
  end

  subgraph Support
    triage[Triage]
  end

  subgraph Engineering
    resolve[Resolve]
  end

  request --> triage --> resolve
